  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bes&#xF6;k fr&#xE5;n Kiev f&#xF6;r anbudsutv&#xE4;rdering 1999-11-30 - 1999-12-05. Tre representanter fr&#xE5;n administrationen i Kiev, Mr Victor Padalka, Mr Valery Deineko, Mr Vyacheslav Vasilenko inbjuds till Sida f&#xF6;r utv&#xE4;rdering av ankomna anbud i Kiev Public Buildnings Energy Efficiency Project. Totalt st&#xF6;d f&#xF6;r insatsen: SEK 42 000.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Visit from Kiev concerning tender evaluations. Three representatives from the administration in Kiev, Mr Victor Padalka, Mr Valery Deineko, Mr Vyacheslav Vasilenko are invited to Sida for evaluation of the presented tenders for the Kiev Public Buildnings Energy Efficiency Project. Total Sida contribution amounts to SEK 42 000.</narrative>
  </description>
